      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "This especially useful for something like the DiverX ContactGlove which uses 107 or 177 bits to give finger tracking.\n\nOther possible additions:\n\n- lower resolution ints and floats would be another possibility as well. I don't need to use 8 bits just to switch between a few outfits.\n\n- changing from a maximum number of bits to a maximum number of bits/second updates combined with the priority would be nice as well since various parameters are not updated very frequently at all.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
