      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Yup, face tracking takes a lot of parameters, either getting double the size, or having those FT parameters synced by VRChat without being counted in the avatar memory space would be a huge improvement !",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
